## New Prompts

New prompts go in `prompts_library/_inbox/`. See the [inbox README](_inbox/README.md) for the workflow.

1. Drop a new `.md` file into `_inbox/`
2. Name it using the convention: `<prefix>-<kebab-slug>.md`
3. Move it to the appropriate category folder when ready
4. Update this catalog with a link to the new location

---

## Naming Convention

```
<prefix>-<kebab-slug>.md
```

**Slug rules**: 2-7 lowercase kebab-case tokens, ASCII only.
